== Notes ==

*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*Contrary to the spell's description, this spell does not have a somatic component, so it can be cast while wearing full armor and shield, ignoring arcane [[spell failure]].
*The +20 attack bonus provided by this spell counts towards the +20 [[attack bonus cap]].
*''True strike'' cannot be extended, even though its duration is neither instantaneous nor permanent.
*''True strike'' cannot be used with the [[craft wand]] feat.

